Successfully integrated your pre-trained MobileNetV2 crack-vs-normal AI classifier (`models/wall_crack_mobilenetv2.keras`) into the existing Wall Crack Analyzer codebase while completely preserving all existing classical image processing pipelines, measurements, and GUI tools.

